  <h2 id="routes">Degree routes by scalability and sales layer</h2>

  <p>
    We lead with the routes where pay can grow furthest through skill, consulting or ownership, and put the rank-based routes last with their risk. Every route stays in the table, because crowded options are still real options.
  </p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
